  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\tan 30^{\\circ}=\\frac{b \\tan \\theta}{a \\sec \\theta}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{b}{a}=\\frac{1}{\\sin \\theta \\sqrt{3}}$\n$e=\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{3 \\sin ^2 \\theta}} > \\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{3}}$\n$\\Rightarrow e > \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}\\left(0  < \\sin ^2 \\theta < 1\\right)$<img src=\"assets\\st0004_481c028a96a5.png\">"
  }
